{"id":"u188","kelas":"theme","no":8,"judul":"Minggu 8: Uang dan Belanja Bijak","title":"Week 8: Money and Smart Shopping","emoji":"💰","ringkas":"Menabung, anggaran, harga, dan keputusan","ready":true,"goals":["mempelajari **kosakata uang dan belanja bijak**","membaca teks tentang **menabung**","menulis **anggaran sederhana**","memakai pola *I can't afford ...* dan *It is worth ...*"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Minggu kedelapan bertema uang dan belanja bijak: anggaran, tabungan, harga, dan keputusan membeli."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Uang","items":[{"en":"money","id":"uang","ex":"I save money every month."},{"en":"cash","id":"uang tunai","ex":"Do you pay in cash?"},{"en":"income","id":"pendapatan","ex":"Her income is low."},{"en":"expense","id":"pengeluaran","ex":"Rent is a big expense."},{"en":"budget","id":"anggaran","ex":"Make a monthly budget."},{"en":"savings","id":"tabungan","ex":"He has some savings."},{"en":"debt","id":"utang","ex":"Avoid debt if you can."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Belanja","items":[{"en":"price","id":"harga","ex":"The price is high."},{"en":"discount","id":"diskon","ex":"There is a discount today."},{"en":"cheap","id":"murah","ex":"This is cheap."},{"en":"expensive","id":"mahal","ex":"That bag is expensive."},{"en":"afford","id":"mampu membeli","ex":"I cannot afford a new phone."},{"en":"worth","id":"sepadan","ex":"Is it worth the money?"},{"en":"bargain","id":"barang murah / menawar","ex":"The jacket was a bargain."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Menabung dan memilih","items":[{"en":"save","id":"menabung / menghemat","ex":"Save ten percent of your money."},{"en":"spend","id":"membelanjakan","ex":"Do not spend it all."},{"en":"waste","id":"membuang-buang","ex":"Do not waste money."},{"en":"need","id":"kebutuhan","ex":"Buy what you need."},{"en":"want","id":"keinginan","ex":"A new game is a want."},{"en":"compare","id":"membandingkan","ex":"Compare prices first."},{"en":"plan","id":"merencanakan","ex":"Plan your spending."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Menabung","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"I want a new phone, but it is expensive.","id":"Aku ingin ponsel baru, tetapi mahal."},{"who":"Mother","en":"Can you afford it?","id":"Apakah kamu mampu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Not yet. I'll save ten percent every month.","id":"Belum. Aku akan menabung sepuluh persen setiap bulan."},{"who":"Mother","en":"Good. Compare prices and wait for a discount.","id":"Bagus. Bandingkan harga dan tunggu diskon."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Buat anggaran sederhana: tulis pemasukan, pengeluaran wajib, tabungan, dan sisa. Beri label setiap pembelian sebagai *need* atau *want*."},{"t":"summary","items":["Uang: [[money]], [[cash]], [[income]], [[expense]], [[budget]], [[savings]].","Belanja: [[price]], [[discount]], [[cheap]], [[expensive]], [[afford]], [[worth]].","Menabung dan memilih: [[save]], [[spend]], [[waste]], [[need]], [[want]], [[compare]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"money\"?","options":["uang","diskon","murah","uang tunai"],"answer":0,"exp":"money = uang.","k":"953783d7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"uang\" adalah...","options":["money","discount","expense","cheap"],"answer":0,"exp":"uang = money.","k":"56a4b6a5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"uang\":","q":"I save ___ every month.","answers":["money","money"],"hint":"m _ _ _ _","exp":"uang = money.","k":"bb20b7fb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"cash\"?","options":["uang tunai","barang murah / menawar","murah","sepadan"],"answer":0,"exp":"cash = uang tunai.","k":"31170c2e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"uang tunai\" adalah...","options":["cash","expensive","cheap","budget"],"answer":0,"exp":"uang tunai = cash.","k":"fc120610"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"uang tunai\":","q":"Do you pay in ___?","answers":["cash","cash"],"hint":"c _ _ _","exp":"uang tunai = cash.","k":"0ee1b7cc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"income\"?","options":["pendapatan","anggaran","uang","k